# Runtime data — the live SQLite database (customer PII, password hashes,
# session tokens) and any uploaded documents (licences/ID photos). Anchored
# "data/*.db" alone would only match a root-level data/ folder, missing
# web/data and crm/data — ** makes it match at any depth.
**/data/

# Large media files (exceeding GitHub's 100MB limit)
*.mp4
